         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Walking Among the Numbers\n\nHave you ever thought about how we move from one number to the next? It seems simple—just add one! But there is a whole world of ideas hidden behind this simple action.\n\nIn this class, we begin our journey into *pre-mathematics*—where we discover basic number ideas through everyday examples. We will focus on addition: learning how to go from one number to the next, step by step.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "c2b3a4d5-f6e7-4b8c-9d0e-1f2a3b4c5d6e",
