         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Axes\n\nMathematics has its own version of a road: the **axis**. Imagine a straight line with marked spots, just like milestones on a highway. Each spot has a number, and an arrow shows which direction the numbers grow.\n\nBelow, you can see the numbers 0 through 9 placed in order. Each one is a step on our mathematical road. The arrow tells us: numbers grow to the right!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
