         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Counting with Our Hands\n\nOur hands are the oldest counting tool in history! Long before calculators or even written numbers, people used their fingers to count.\n\nEach finger represents one number. When we raise a finger, we move to the next number. Look at the hands below—each finger is a step forward on our number road.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
